# Keep the USB camera out of USB autosuspend. The first camera (32e6:9221) was put
# to sleep two seconds after every photo, and each drop-off seen on it came in the
# second a photo began, while it woke up. Its successor, the UGREEN Camera 2K
# (0c45:6370, since 30 September), is kept awake the same way.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="0c45", ATTR{idProduct}=="6370", TEST=="power/control", ATTR{power/control}="on"
